/**
\page MSG_CANT_PLACE_FROGPOINTS Frog|Points cannot be placed on a turnout, circle or helix.

The frog or points of a hand-laid turnout cannot be placed on a turnout, circle
or helix track. Choose a straight or curved section of track or use the
**Split** command to create a curve from the circle track.

Refer to \ref cmdHandLaidTurnout "hand laid turnouts" for detail regarding hand
laid turnouts or \ref cmdSplitTrack "the Split command" for detail regarding the
**Split** command.
*/
